	(text "System-5 IO panel card Rev A, one sheet per functional block:\n  sheet 2  Decode         PORT DECODE: THE IN AND OUT PORTS ON JUMPERS, AND THE STROBES\n  sheet 3  Output         THE OUT PORT: LATCH, EIGHT LEDS, TWO TIL311 HEX DISPLAYS\n  sheet 4  Address        THE BUS ADDRESS ON FOUR TIL311 HEX DISPLAYS\n  sheet 5  Input          THE IN PORT (AND LOAD DATA): EIGHT TOGGLE SWITCHES\n  sheet 6  Control        INPUT BUTTON ON A JUMPER-PICKED EF LINE, RUN AND LOAD, ONE DMA IN PER PRESS, Q LED\n  sheet 7  Real-time clock DS12885 CLOCK, CALENDAR AND NVRAM ON A JUMPER-PICKED PORT PAIR\n  sheet 8  Serial port    16C550 UART ON THE CLOCK'S PORT PAIR, MAX232, DE-9\n  sheet 9  Power          POWER, DECOUPLING, POWER LED\n\nRedrawn from the board netlist; proven pin for pin against it (gen_schematic.py).\n\nEvery net of a sheet is a pin of its sheet symbol here, labelled with the net's name. Above a dashed line:\nthe nets the sheet shares with other sheets (left: it reads them, right: it drives them). Below it: nets\ndrawn on that sheet only. VCC and GND are power symbols on the sheets." (exclude_from_sim no) (at 25.4 15.24 0) (effects (font (size 1.5 1.5)) (justify left top)) (uuid "edeb3735-fa21-5191-8764-a1fdc23abc1f"))
	(sheet_instances (path "/" (page "1")))
	(embedded_fonts no)
)
